  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project by the embassy for local support Holland Circular Hotspot Mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To assist the implementing partner of the scoping study, Holland Circular Hotspot (HCH) and the Netherlands consulate-general in Lagos, a local consultant with a strong network in the waste management sector is needed to do some preparatory work for the scoping visit of the 28th of October to the 1st of November. Therefore, via this project, a small budget is delegated to the University of Lagos to provide local services.</narrative>
  </description>
